exports[`CommandOfficeRoom > keeps Control team navigation across Office, Workflow, and Experts 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-team" data-shell-view="team"><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header is-actions-empty" data-od-id="team-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="团队视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="office" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>办公室</span></button><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="workflow" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>协作流</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="experts" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>专家团</span></button></div></header><section class="team-workflow-shell" data-card-filter="workflow" data-od-id="team-workflow-shell" data-workflow-shell=""><section aria-labelledby="_R_3_" class="command-team-empty-state" data-team-empty-state="empty"><span class="command-team-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-workflow"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><div class="command-team-empty-copy"><span class="command-team-empty-eyebrow">协作流</span><h2 id="_R_3_">还没有协作流</h2><p>创建后，团队成员会按设定步骤接力完成任务。</p></div><footer class="command-team-empty-footer"><button class="button primary" type="button">创建协作流</button></footer></section></section><section class="team-experts-shell" data-card-filter="experts" data-od-id="team-experts-shell" hidden=""><section aria-labelledby="_R_4_" class="command-team-e