exports[`CommandOfficeRoom > keeps Experts as a leader single-chat catalog independent from Office records 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-team" data-shell-view="team"><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header function-market-header" data-od-id="team-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="团队视图筛选"><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="office" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>办公室</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter="workflow" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>协作流</span></button><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip mode-tab active" data-filter="experts" data-filter-group="team-mode" type="button"><span>专家团</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><button class="button" type="button" disabled="" hidden="">同步</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="office" disabled="" hidden="">创建办公室</button><button class="button primary" type="button" data-team-action="experts" disabled="">创建专家团</button></div></header><section class="team-workflow-shell" data-card-filter="workflow" data-od-id="team-workflow-shell" data-workflow-shell="" hidden=""><section aria-labelledby="_R_3_" class="command-team-empty-state" data-team-empty-state="empty"><span class="command-team-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-workflow"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"></rect></svg></span><div class="command-team-empty-copy"><span class="command-team-empty-eyebrow">协作流</span><h2 id="_R_3_">还没有协作流</h2><p>创建后，团队成员会按设定步骤接力完成任务。</p></div><footer class="command-team-empty-footer"><button class="button" type="button">重新同步</button></footer></section></section><section class="team-experts-shell" data-card-filter="experts" data-od-id="team-experts-shell"><section class="expert-team-grid" aria-label="专家团"><article class="expert-team-card"><div class="expert-team-card-head"><span class="expert-team-card-glyph" aria-hidden="true">代</span><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>团长单聊 · 后台协作</span><strong>代码审阅专家团</strong></div></div><p class="expert-team-goal">由团长汇总审阅结论。</p><div class="expert-member-stack"><span class="is-leader" title="分派审阅并汇总结论"><i aria-hidden="true">团</i><span><b>团长：审阅团长</b><small>分派审阅并汇总结论</small></span></span><span title="定位风险"><i aria-hidden="true">探</i><span><b>探索专家：风险专家</b><small>定位风险</small></span></span></div><footer class="expert-team-card-foot"><span>2 名成员 · 1 个对话入口</span><button class="button primary compact" type="button">进入团长单聊<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></footer></article></section></section><div id="team-log" class="sr-log" aria-live="polite"></div></div></section>"`;

